color='#566573'&gt;airline_seat_db&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#14202c;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="756" y="330" width="112" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-14" value="&lt;b&gt;booking-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;:5009&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;airline_booking_db&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#14202c;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="878" y="330" width="112" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-15" value="&lt;b&gt;payment-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;:5010&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;airline_payment_db&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#14202c;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="330" width="112" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-16" value="&lt;b&gt;notification-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;:5012&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;airline_notification_db&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#14202c;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1122" y="330" width="112" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-17" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#8a4b0f'&gt;Kafka 4: 10 topics&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;producers insert into their own outbox_event table in the business transaction; OutboxRelay sends after commit; consumers are idempotent. Failed records: retry with backoff, then &amp;lt;topic&amp;gt;-dlt&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f6ece1;strokeColor=#8a4b0f;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="470" width="1210" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-18" value="&lt;b&gt;MySQL 8.4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;one database per service (named in each box), Flyway migrations, ddl-auto validate. No service reads another service's tables.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9eef2;strokeColor=#566573;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="560" width="1210" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-19" value="&lt;b&gt;Razorpay&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;payment links, refunds API&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f5f7;strokeColor=#566573;dashed=1;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="650" width="150" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-20" value="&lt;b&gt;SMTP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;Mailpit :8025 locally&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f5f7;strokeColor=#566573;dashed=1;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="650" width="150" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-21" value="&lt;b&gt;Observability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;Prometheus scrapes :51xx/actuator/prometheus · Grafana :3000 · Tempo traces (carried through Kafka) · Kafka UI :8090&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f5f7;strokeColor=#566573;dashed=1;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="650" width="520" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map-22" value="HTTPS · Authorization: Be