ance or booking id), so one booking's events stay in order on one partition. Delivery is at least once; each consumer de-duplicates (processed_inventory_event, unique refund_key, unique event key + channel, payment id / refund reference checks)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#566573;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="800" width="1100" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="calls" name="3. Service-to-service calls"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1100" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="calls-1" value="Synchronous calls (OpenFeign via Eureka, token relayed)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#14202c;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="0" width="800" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="calls-2" value="&lt;b&gt;booking-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;orchestrates checkout + cancel&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#14202c;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="200" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="calls-3" value="&lt;b&gt;flight-ops-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;flights, instances, search&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#14202c;fontColor=#14202c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="110" width="200" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="calls-4" value="&lt;b&gt;seat-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px' color='#566573'&gt;cabins, seat maps, holds&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteS